OL,3,GNEWSATourist tax: Who would pay and
OL,4,Awhere would it go?
OL,5,
OL,6,FHolidaymakers in the New Forest could
OL,7,Fone day be paying a tourist tax on
OL,8,Ftheir accommodation under new
OL,9,Fgovernment plans.
OL,11,FThe levy would be optional, with areas
OL,12,Fable to choose whether to have one, how
OL,13,Fmuch to charge and how the money is
OL,14,Fspent.
OL,16,FOne of the area's biggest holiday park
OL,17,Foperators has said it is "strongly
OL,18,Fopposed" to the tax, warning that it
OL,19,Fcould deter tourists from visiting the
OL,20,Farea.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
